    <string name="bank_noti_info_dialog_title">How Notification Capture Works</string>
    <string name="bank_noti_info_dialog_message">Wimple operates as follows:\n\n• Only notifications from apps you selected in \"Apps to Monitor\" are read. Notifications from any other app are ignored.\n\n• Captured notifications are cached in this app\'s private storage only. Due to Android\'s app-sandbox policy, no other app or file manager can access this cache.\n\n• Stored notifications are forwarded to the Whooing service only — never to any other external server.\n\n• Forwarded notifications are deleted from the cache. You can inspect or clear the current cache via \"View Stored Notifications\".</string>

